{"info": {"address1": "Express Trade Towers", "address2": "8th Floor Plot No. 15 & 16, Sector 16-A", "city": "Noida", "zip": "201301", "country": "India", "phone": "91 12 0430 8000", "fax": "91 12 0431 1010", "website": "https://www.trivenigroup.com", "industry": "Confectioners", "industryKey": "confectioners", "industryDisp": "Confectioners", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "Triveni Engineering & Industries Limited engages in the sugar and allied businesses, and engineering businesses in India and internationally. The company is involved in the production of refined sugar, multi-grade white crystal sugar, and pharmaceutical-grade sugar; power generation using captively produced bagasse; production of alcohol/ethanol using molasses; operation of distilleries; and production of ethanol, extra neutral alcohol, and potable liquor. It also engages in the manufacture of low-speed gears and gear boxes covering supply to OEMs, after-market services, and retrofitment of gearboxes; EPC contracts, equipment supply, and operations and maintenance contracts; operation of fuel stations; and retail of diesel/petrol. In addition, the company provides engineered-to-order process equipment and comprehensive solutions; propulsion and other critical gearboxes, critical turbo and motor driven pumps, gas turbine generators for auxiliary power, fin stabilizers, propulsion shafting, winches, and engineered solutions; water treatment, water and wastewater network management, wastewater/sewage treatment, desalination for seawater and brackish water, recycle and zero liquid discharge services; and operation and maintenance contracts, products and process audits, health check-ups, upgradation of existing plants, and on-site support, as well as spares and services. It serves industrial clusters, refineries, coal, sand processing plant, non-ferrous industries, oil and gas, thermal and hydro power plants, steel plants, sugar and allied industries, and desalination industries. Triveni Engineering & Industries Limited was incorporated in 1932 and is headquartered in Noida, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 2850, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Dhruv Manmohan Sawhney", "age": 81, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1944, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26048000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Tarun  Sawhney", "age": 52, "title": "Vice Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 115744000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Suresh K. Taneja", "age": 72, "title": "Group Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Geeta  Bhalla", "title": "Group VP, Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Priyanka  Jain", "title": "Head of Corporate Communications", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjeev  Asthana", "title": "Vice President of Human Resources", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajiv  Rajpal", "title": "Chief Executive Officer of Power Transmission Business", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sameer  Sinha", "title": "Chief Executive Officer of Sugar Business Group", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. B. K. Agrawal", "title": "President of Corporate", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Ashok  Kumar", "title": "VP of Sugar & Head of Khatauli Sugar Unit", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "irWebsite": "http://www.trivenigro